{"id":"79c50f49bb7604ff","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-resolution-derived-premises.md","title":"已导出子句可作为归结前提","display":"lem-resolution-derived-premises — 已导出子句可作为归结前提","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-resolution-derived-premises","aliases":["72-lem-resolution-derived-premises"],"display":"lem-resolution-derived-premises — 已导出子句可作为归结前提","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-derivation]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; explicit finite proof composition","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-resolution-derived-premises"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-resolution-derived-premises</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-resolution-derived-premises — 已导出子句可作为归结前提"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"57108f066c5d47ce\" href=\"?note=57108f066c5d47ce\" title=\"72-df-resolution-derivation\">72-df-resolution-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; explicit finite proof composition"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResCl},\\operatorname{ResDer},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResCl},\\operatorname{ResDer},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57108f066c5d47ce\" href=\"?note=57108f066c5d47ce\" title=\"72-df-resolution-derivation\">72-df-resolution-derivation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)\">\\(G\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResCl}(G)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ResCl}(G)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,G)\\bigr)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\rho,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,G)\\bigr)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\rho,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中子句已有从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 出发的有限推导。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的有限枚举串接这些推导，并把所有父行索引按相应段起点平移；之后接上原来从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 出发的推导，把其初始行指向前段已得到的对应子句。归结行仍引用较早的两个父行。也可按闭包阶段归纳直接用归结闭合性得到包含关系，末子句为空即得第二式。没有要求两个前提子句互异。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"57108f066c5d47ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"57108f066c5d47ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,G$、$\\operatorname{ResCl},\\operatorname{ResDer},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 同 [[72-df-resolution-derivation]]；$G\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)$，且 $G$ 有限。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResCl},\\operatorname{ResDer},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResCl}(G)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,G)\\bigr)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\rho,F).","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1658,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-resolution-derived-premises|lem-resolution-derived-premises — 已导出子句可作为归结前提]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-441","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-resolution-derived-premises]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-resolution-derived-premises|lem-resolution-derived-premises — 已导出子句可作为归结前提]]"},{"id":"44d3a4bd8308f551","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-401","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-resolution-derived-premises]]"}],"outgoing":["57108f066c5d47ce"]}